        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='2000' maxwidth='1360' minheight='2000' minwidth='1360' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4800' id='361' type-v2='text' w='71397' x='368' y='500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#476fa2' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='28'>Getting Started with the Fulfilment Time Report</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='4200' id='364' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='25662' x='73529' y='500'>
          <zone fixed-size='224' forceUpdate='true' h='4200' id='362' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='17059' x='73529' y='500'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#cc081f' fontsize='26'>Local Shops</run>
              <run fontalignment='2'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#4e5862'>QUICK-COMMERCE</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4200' id='363' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Comet.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='8603' x='90588' y='500'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='94250' id='879' type-v2='text' w='99265' x='368' y='5400'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>1. Overview</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Fulfilment Time Report</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> dashboard is designed to monitor and analyze the time metrics associated with order fulfilment. It enables users to filter and examine various aspects of the fulfilment process across multiple dimensions, such as entity, country, chain, vendor, and time intervals.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Note: this dashboard only have Pelican Orders information.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>2. Available Filters</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Entity</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Select specific entities (e.g., regions or business units) to narrow down the displayed data.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Account Manager</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters the data by the account manager responsible for the entities or vendors.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Country</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data based on the country where the orders were fulfilled.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- City</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Further refines the country filter by specifying the city.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Is AAA Supermarket</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data specifically for supermarkets categorized as AAA.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Store Type L1 &amp; L2</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data based on store type at two hierarchical levels.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- In/Out (Chain &amp; Vendor IDs Filters)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Switches between including or excluding specific chains and vendors based on provided IDs.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Chain IDs Filter</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data for specific chains by entering their IDs.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Vendor IDs Filter</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data for specific vendors by entering their IDs.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Vendor Have on Avg ≥ Order per Day</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters vendors based on their average orders per day.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Is Preorder</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data to include or exclude preorder items.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Has Scanned Items</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Allows filtering based on whether orders include scanned items.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Has Replacements in Last 30 Days</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data to show vendors that had replacements in orders within the last 30 days.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Confirmed Orders with Replacements</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Focuses on orders that had confirmed replacements.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Picking App</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters based on the application used for picking the order.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Has Weighted Products</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters data based on whether the orders included weighted products.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Picker Contract Type</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Filters by the type of contract held by the picker.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Time Unit</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Allows users to select the time unit (e.g., Minutes, Hours) to measure fulfilment time.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Time Measured by</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Defines the basis for measuring time, such as by order or by item.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Granularity</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Specifies the time interval for data analysis (e.g., Daily, Weekly, Monthly, Quarterly, Semiannually).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- # of Periods</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Determines the number of periods (e.g., days, weeks, months) to include in the analysis.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Show Fulfilment Time Outliers</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Toggles the display of outliers in the fulfilment time data.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  An outlier is any order with a:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Transmission Time &gt; 30 min</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Hold Back Time &gt; 1.5 Hours</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Started Time &gt; 1.5 Hours</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Picking Time &gt; 1.5 Hours</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Ready to Pickup Time &gt; 1 Hour</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>3. Key Metrics</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Fulfilment Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The total time taken from order placement to the order being ready for pickup, segmented by step.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  -  Process Timestamp (ts):</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> placed_at_ts - created_at_ts - available_at_pelican_ts - started_at_ts - checkout_confirmed_at_ts - ready_for_pickup_ts.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Fulfilment Time Full</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The total time taken from order placement to the order being ready for pickup.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>placed_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>ready_for_pickup_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Ready to Pickup Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The time taken from the order being picked and confirmed to the order being ready for customer pickup. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>checkout_confirmed_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>ready_for_pickup_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Picking Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The time taken specifically for the picker to collect all items in the order. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>started_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>checkout_confirmed_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Started Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The duration from when the order was available for picking until the picker began collecting items. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>available_at_pelican_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>started_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Hold Back Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The time between when an order get to the vendor&apos;s system until the order was available in Pelican for Picking.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>created_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>available_at_pelican_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Transmission Time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: The time taken to transmit the order details from the customer to the vendor&apos;s system. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>  This metric measure the time from </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>placed_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>until </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>created_at_ts</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- % Items Not Delivered</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Percentage of ordered items not delivered to the user due to OOS of Confirmed Orders or OOS Failed Orders. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- % Items Not Found</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: Percentage of ordered items not delivered to the user due to OOS (including replacements) of Confirmed Orders or OOS Failed Orders.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Important Note: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>in this dashboard, only the </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>% Items Not Delivered </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>and the </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>% Items Not Found</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> from orders with properly recorded Fulfilment Time will be considered. As a result, this metric will not match those in other reports.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>4. Views</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Overview</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: this sheet provides a comprehensive visualization of key fulfilment time metrics. It displays segmented data across various dimensions like entity, country, chain, and vendor. The sheet helps users quickly identify trends and performance across different segments, with clear visualizations such as bar charts and heatmaps. This high-level summary is ideal for getting an overall sense of fulfilment efficiency.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Tabular View</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>: this sheet offers a flexible, in-depth analysis of fulfilment time metrics. It features three adjustable views that allow users to switch between different perspectives by modifying the table layout. This sheet is designed for detailed comparison and examination of metrics across multiple dimensions, enabling users to tailor the analysis to their specific needs.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
